$CA87 FillSlotsChannel
$CA88 FillSlotsLoop

$CAAF c MusicFrame ; Every frame: UpdateVoices, then one step of the tune on each channel
> UpdateVoices; nothing more when MusicPlaying is 0. MusicPlaying = the OR of the channels' +$0D; when 0 it is set to 1 while a voice sounds (0 when all are free) and nothing more; else SequenceChannel for A, B and C (IY = ChannelA-C, IX = VoiceA-C; C falls into SequenceChannel).
> Called from MusicFrameCall $7AB6 every interrupt: 23 034 runs in the 9 builds, the channels 10 060.
> Witness: L1 24223 (controls-cursor, controls-kempston, controls-keyboard, controls-sinclair, sec-l1-s8, c1, load-l2-load-l5).
