$CD09 b StealTurn ; The voice the next effect takes when none is free: 0-2, A-C in turn
> PickEffectVoice: incremented (1, 2, 0, ...) each time an effect other than 0 or 2 finds all three voices busy (15 times in the 9 builds).

$CD0A c PickEffectVoice ; IX = a voice for effect A: the first free one, else the next in turn; no carry: none
> A voice is free when all its bits are set in MixerShadow. A, then B, then C; with none free, effects 0 (the footstep) and 2 (the fuse) return no carry (dropped) and the others take the voice StealTurn names after its increment. 44 runs (c1 only): a free voice 24 (A 12, B or C 12), a voice taken 15, dropped 5.
> Witness: L1 44 (c1).
$CD1B PickVoiceFree
$CD1C PickVoiceFound
$CD1E PickVoiceTestB
$CD4F PickVoiceSteal

